-- (2015-2016) that only had 1st and 2nd (Matthew, 2026-11-19: "continue improving smash history in rounds,
-- read liquipedia by hand if it's the best source"). Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome from each
-- tournament's own Liquipedia page, several seconds apart; each page's 1st and 2nd checked against the
-- names already saved (all 20 agree). Facts only (places and names), credited to Liquipedia (CC-BY-SA);
-- single-game majors' source links now point at their own page. Only fills brackets that still have 2
-- places or fewer; safe to run twice.

